        {
          "id": "player_tired_001_02",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "今は根性じゃなくて、少し軽くする作戦にしよ。まず肩の力を抜いて。",
          "displayText": "Right now, use a lighter plan, not willpower. First, let your shoulders loosen.",
